# Wild Pokémon (round 1, feedback 1.28, docs/hack_wild.md): the Pokédex is National from Birch's lab
# (D-196), Granite Cave 1F and Petalburg Woods hand out wild battles from the new tables, and Bug Catcher
# Rick (Route 102) leads with his Gen 4-9 swap, Kricketot (D-195).
# Needs rustboro_done.ss from tests/rustboro.play in the same output directory. Each wild battle prints the
# wild Pokémon's species id (gBattleMons[1].species; struct BattlePokemon is 0x8C bytes, species first, speed
# at +6) and a screenshot, then the player runs away: the test party is a Lv 6 hatchling, too weak for Granite
# Cave, so its battle speed is poked to 1023 (a faster Pokémon always escapes) and B, DOWN, RIGHT, A picks RUN.
# The walk and the run use key cycles in "until" (needs the gbarun strtok_r fix). Encounters depend on the
# ROM build (RNG): round 1 builds showed Woobat (527) in Granite Cave and Nymble (1303), Morelull (755) and Combee (415) in
# the woods. Compare the ids with include/constants/species.h and `python3 tools/hack/check_wild.py --changes`;
# the 1% Beldum is checked statically by check_wild.py.
loadstate rustboro_done.ss
expect_flag FLAG_SYS_POKEDEX_GET 1
expect_flag FLAG_SYS_NATIONAL_DEX 1
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_TRAINER_SEE
setflag FLAG_DRACONID_NO_WHITEOUT
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
heal
# --- Granite Cave 1F: the upper corridor (row 4)
warp MAP_GRANITE_CAVE_1F 20 4
run 60
clearflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
repeat 3 press LEFT 2 16
until @gMain+4 4 @@BattleMainCB2 20000 LEFT,LEFT,LEFT,LEFT,RIGHT,RIGHT,RIGHT,RIGHT 18
run 400
read @gBattleMons+8C 2 granite_1_species
poke @gBattleMons+6 FF
poke @gBattleMons+7 03
shot w01_granite
until @gMain+4 4 !@@BattleMainCB2 20000 B,DOWN,RIGHT,A 24
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
run 120
heal
clearflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
until @gMain+4 4 @@BattleMainCB2 20000 LEFT,LEFT,LEFT,LEFT,RIGHT,RIGHT,RIGHT,RIGHT 18
run 400
read @gBattleMons+8C 2 granite_2_species
poke @gBattleMons+6 FF
poke @gBattleMons+7 03
shot w02_granite
until @gMain+4 4 !@@BattleMainCB2 20000 B,DOWN,RIGHT,A 24
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
run 120
heal
clearflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
until @gMain+4 4 @@BattleMainCB2 20000 LEFT,LEFT,LEFT,LEFT,RIGHT,RIGHT,RIGHT,RIGHT 18
run 400
read @gBattleMons+8C 2 granite_3_species
poke @gBattleMons+6 FF
poke @gBattleMons+7 03
shot w03_granite
until @gMain+4 4 !@@BattleMainCB2 20000 B,DOWN,RIGHT,A 24
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
run 120
heal
clearflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
until @gMain+4 4 @@BattleMainCB2 20000 LEFT,LEFT,LEFT,LEFT,RIGHT,RIGHT,RIGHT,RIGHT 18
run 400
read @gBattleMons+8C 2 granite_4_species
poke @gBattleMons+6 FF
poke @gBattleMons+7 03
shot w04_granite
until @gMain+4 4 !@@BattleMainCB2 20000 B,DOWN,RIGHT,A 24
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
run 120
heal
